      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file stream_completion.py that streams partial output tokens from a hosted LLM, I need to select a concrete external provider and use their identifiable code. I will choose Amazon Bedrock for this task, as it is a well-known provider with a specific model identifier. </thinking>\n",
