        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `extract_json.py` that calls a hosted LLM to extract structured JSON from text, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which is a concrete external provider. The code will import the necessary SDK and use the specific model identifier to make the integration identifiable. </thinking>\n",
